# Every route is prerendered to <route>/index.html (vite-react-ssg, nested
# dirStyle), so real pages are plain static files and need no rewriting.
# Anything else is a genuine 404: serve the prerendered 404 page with a 404
# status, rather than the homepage with a 200 (a "soft 404" to search engines).
ErrorDocument 404 /404/index.html
